1
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:10,115
Nani! Look, the new anklets you gave me! Chham-chham-chham!

2
00:00:10,615 --> 00:00:13,485
They look lovely, my little doll!

3
00:00:14,085 --> 00:00:17,210
In Nani's village the sky is full of stars!

4
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:22,305
Come on kids, time to sleep. And keep the anklets on the window, Pinky.

5
00:00:22,705 --> 00:00:24,675
Okay Nani. Good night!

6
00:00:28,275 --> 00:00:30,810
Tinku! Wake up! Someone's walking on the roof!

7
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:33,655
At midnight? Who'd be on the roof?

8
00:00:34,655 --> 00:00:37,390
And that's... that's the sound of MY anklets!

9
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:40,420
Look at the window... your anklets are gone!

10
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:43,005
A ghost is wearing my anklets!

11
00:00:43,505 --> 00:00:46,560
Don't be scared. Take the torch, let's go up slowly.

12
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:50,675
Shhh! Look at the wall... a shadow!

13
00:00:51,275 --> 00:00:52,590
It has... HORNS!

14
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:53,440
Meh-eh-eh!

15
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,880
And what's that crunch-crunch? Something's chewing!

16
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:01,955
Wait... there's dry hay here. And hoof prints!

17
00:01:02,355 --> 00:01:04,535
Hooves? Do ghosts have hooves?

18
00:01:05,935 --> 00:01:07,585
One... two... three... torch ON!

19
00:01:08,785 --> 00:01:11,470
Hey! It's Nani's goat, Chameli!

20
00:01:11,970 --> 00:01:15,215
And on her legs... your anklets are stuck! Ha ha!

21
00:01:15,615 --> 00:01:16,165
Meh-meh!

22
00:01:17,565 --> 00:01:20,265
Chameli is dancing! Chham-chham-chham!

23
00:01:21,465 --> 00:01:25,620
Hey! All this noise at night? Chameli! How did you get up here?

24
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:29,245
Nani, she grabbed the anklets from the window and ran up here!

25
00:01:29,745 --> 00:01:32,840
Ha ha! Chameli likes dressing up too!

26
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:38,485
I got my anklets back... but now Chameli is sad.

27
00:01:38,985 --> 00:01:42,830
Then let's tie a little bell on Chameli!

28
00:01:44,030 --> 00:01:44,580
Meh-meh!

29
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:49,340
Next time: Golu's crazy race with the vegetables!

30
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,245
Bye-bye, friends!

31
00:01:51,545 --> 00:01:52,535
Bye-bye!
